ームクーヘン＝「あなたとの関係が続くように」  \n- マドレーヌ＝「あなたともっと仲良くなりたい」 \n- クッキー＝「あなたは友達」  \n- マシュマロ＝「あなたが嫌いです」  \n- チョコレート＝特別な意味はありません。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@asahinamiya/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1103445, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/281373/0/vtt/0.vtt?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1783020057&Signature=hn0rgzmnwXqsIgw9q9-1T6ciY3gCnEWr5YkjjSjKrzsXrEABi3OyWq18pwcWzCGgHRPu9T35ZA0dj5iKB1ywGqGH~R7r0oHYtQ2sk9L3kmovctZVzZwFknCj2FRol8Nf1OW21TThdiJrTcu04LrNvw5qoDEtuWEvsNmmmAFg53~yV2VaKFAtt0fTy6gZ-vRHo2bMvhn-~uXxQW1CceHy2Y23b2eU~PsKq3oe5dG5HWJVJT8GgcTJDlYl9U7f1g7VgK3JLz3jt0fZHPbw-kRDdQVdm2q8d9eZ78RZkt8zI~tJ80TX72o34TzhDDGHJZ4gJ~sP9Me19TnYdW-45AsGDw__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1625695471632277504%2FWKJSEHOl.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7feccc2ffd75268d343aa4b8d20842f", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1625695471632277504%2FWKJSEHOl.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7feccc2ffd75268d343aa4b8d20842f, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1625695471632277504%2FWKJSEHOl.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ca2be284659677e791fbfb70b13452e 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1625695471632277504%2FWKJSEHOl.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67b1dc9cc76ed92fa8ca02c8fedf864e 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/281373/0/mp3_128k/0?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1783020057&Signature=QdVz3HBJjlfhF0Ey3u0fxI9tn7CmjVpbm7Wbw65s-ReIuR0zkBOL7MjUaylnvrpDDL7y9j3nCU